                    \-equivariant and R-motivic stable stems
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1603.09305"} arXiv:1603.09305
          %p with exposition in
          %ul
            %li#Dugger08
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Daniel+Dugger"}> Daniel Dugger
              ,
